# mcp__ripwire_uses — ripwire/uses

The STATICALLY RESOLVABLE use-sites of a symbol, not just calls: role (call | read | write | import | extends), file:line, and enclosing symbol. Use to see the footprint before renaming or changing a name — find_referencing_symbols and impact follow only calls. external="1" means no definition in the indexed tree; count="0" is a real answer, and counts_floor="1" says count= is a FLOOR (the legend names the causes). symbol = the bare name, the union across same-named defs (file:name narrowing is CLI-only); an @FILE:LINE seed serves the enclosing definition's sites and of= echoes it as typed. limit/offset page the sites.

## Schema
```ts
type Args = {
  /** a STRING repo directory */
  path?: string;
  /** an ARRAY of 1..16 repo roots */
  paths?: string[];
  /** a symbol name to find the resolvable use-sites of (an @FILE:LINE line-seed serves the enclosing definition's name) */
  symbol: string;
  /** a positive integer (omit for the default window) */
  limit?: number;
  /** a non-negative integer (omit to start at row 1) */
  offset?: number;
  /** a STRING legend posture: compact (the default) or full (restores the full legend) */
  legend?: string;
};
```
